	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S. D.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Discessurus in agrum etc. haec scribo celerrime etc.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z2"/>Principio scripsi ad d. <persName ref="p8160">Bellievreum</persName> petens, ut vel ipse <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>scribat d. <persName>Beato</persName> vel ipse ascendat <placeName ref="l98">Curiam</placeName> suamque i<lb xml:id="p1z4"/>nterponat authoritatem.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">De conscriptis comitiis mira habe<lb xml:id="p1z5"/>rem, si calamo credere liceret.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Nostri, mihi crede, optim<lb xml:id="p1z6"/>e erga vos sunt animati, et commissionem legati habent optimam<lb xml:id="p1z7"/>, ne quid vel in minima re religioni adversum faciant [<lb xml:id="p1z8"/>aut] consentiant etc.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Scripsi <placeName ref="l41">Bernam</placeName> ad d. <persName ref="p8063">consulem Steigerum</persName><note type="misc">...<persName ref="p8063">Steigeri</persName>!</note>, commenda<lb xml:id="p1z9"/>vi ei negotium; scripsi <placeName ref="l646">Claronam</placeName> ad <persName ref="p3203">Casparem Tschudum</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>et <persName ref="p8440">Schuͦlerum</persName> rogans, in hoc sint, ut <persName ref="p252">Beldius</persName> mittatur <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>legatus.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Scripsi ad <persName ref="p252">Beldium</persName> ipsum; hic putat mittendum <lb xml:id="p1z12"/><persName ref="p8440">Schuͦlerum</persName>.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Nostri legati sunt viri boni et faventes <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>religioni.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Diu expectavit senatus d. <persName>a Chaam</persName>; sed <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>nondum rediit <placeName ref="l18">Augusta</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Oremus dominum, mi frater, ut ipse <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>motam tempestatem componat, qui optimus est compositor etc.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z16"/>Scripsi etiam <placeName ref="l2451">Apptzellam</placeName> ad amicos meos hortans, ut <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>laboranti rei subveniant et religionem veram inprimis <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>sibi commendatam habeant etc.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Mirum est, quam mira<lb xml:id="p1z19"/>biles se homines exhibeant in hac caussa; quid futurum <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>putas in alia et maiore?</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Domine serva nos<lb xml:id="p1z21"/>.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">- <placeName ref="l210">Heydelberga</placeName> scribitur comitia finienda <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>et forte iam finita esse.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la"><placeName>Wirtenberg[icum]</placeName> et <placeName>B<lb xml:id="p1z23"/>ipontinum</placeName> omnibus viribus nixos voluisse <placeName>Palatinum</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>ex pace (ut vocant) religionis excludere, sed <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>non sine rubore laterem lavisse<note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1">sich vergeblich bemühen; vgl. <bibl source="b56">Adagia</bibl>, 1, 4, 48 (<bibl source="b370">LB</bibl> II 169).</note>.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="de"><foreign xml:lang="la">Maximi fieri <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>a bonis <placeName>Palatinum</placeName> ob constantiam et sobrietatem,</foreign> <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>metui a malis, und das der religion [halb] nitt wyter <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>werde gehandlet werden; man lasse es blyben wie <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>unzhar.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="de">Der Pfaltzgraff wirt jetzund refor<lb xml:id="p1z30"/>mieren sin Undere <placeName>Pfaltz</placeName>, das doch den nachburen <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>unlydenlich ist; er fart aber für.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la">Laudemus <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>dominum et oremus, ut nobis pergat benedicere etc.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell"><lb xml:id="p1z33"/>Vale.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la">Dominus benedicat tibi et liberet te a malo.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z34"/>Nullis laboribus peperci, feci, quae facere <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>potui; benedicat dominus negotio.</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la">19. maii 66.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z36"/><persName ref="p495">Bullingerus</persName> tuus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la" ana="salute"><lb xml:id="p1z37"/>Saluta fratres.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="de"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Dem wolgelerten, frommen <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>und getruwen <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>h. <persName ref="p8009">Hansen Schmid</persName>, pre<lb xml:id="p2z4"/>dicanten zuͦ <placeName ref="l98">Chur</placeName>, min<lb xml:id="p2z5"/>em lieben herren <lb xml:id="p2z6"/>und gevattern.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
